          "$a = \\dfrac{f(x_2) - f(x_1)}{x_2 - x_1}$",
          "$a = \\dfrac{7500 - 3500}{6 - 2}$",
          "$a = \\dfrac{4000}{4}$",
          "$a = 1000$"
